<title>UK: LIFFE Italian debt futures hit new all-time high.</title>
<headline>LIFFE Italian debt futures hit new all-time high.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian BTP futures on LIFFE rallied to a new all-time high on Monday, breaking above the previous record of 130.10.</p>
<p>The 130.10 record was set on December 31.</p>
<p>March BTP futures were quoted at 130.15 at 1516 GMT, up 1.37 on the day.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6176</p>
